tory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#canaan","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"canaan","dateCreated":"2020-06-08T18:39:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T19:04:56+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"As a fabless chip-design enterprise, Canaan Creative became one of the first companies with advanced processing techniques in mainland China. By choosing AWS services and solutions, Canaan Creative has built a comprehensive system covering data security, network security, operation security, and audit review.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/canaan-logo@1x.e53f6ba1941cd8d2390487624f13b7f6d7394748.png","displayLocation":"Asia Pacific","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Manufacturing","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/canaan/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Canaan Creative case study","customer-name":"Canaan Creative"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#datacenter-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-ref